1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:07,500
Today, commerce still depends heavily on trust between parties --

2
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:14,200
and that becomes even harder when humans, businesses, and AI agents transact with each other.

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:20,800
VeriqoMesh is programmable trust infrastructure for human and AI commerce.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,800
Authorized AI agents can execute normal transactions within policy bounds.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,800
Evidence and verification establish what happened.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:37,200
And when an outcome is genuinely contested, AI organizes the evidence,

7
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:41,200
humans adjudicate, and the blockchain enforces the authorized settlement.

8
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,750
AI executes. Humans adjudicate. Blockchain enforces.

9
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,500
The important design choice is that human intervention is not required for every transaction.

10
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:56,800
Normal transactions can be executed autonomously by an authorized AI agent.

11
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:03,570
Human adjudication is reserved for the exception -- when evidence becomes inconclusive or the outcome is contested.

12
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,500
Here is the normal path.

13
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:13,200
The transaction begins with an AUTHORIZED AI AGENT operating within a predefined POLICY BOUND.

14
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:20,500
The agent can create the agreement, fund the ESCROW PROTECTED transaction, coordinate execution, and provide EVIDENCE.

15
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:25,500
An independent verifier evaluates the evidence.

16
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:30,800
When VERIFICATION: PASS is returned, the settlement condition is satisfied.

17
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:37,500
AUTONOMOUS RELEASE UNLOCKED: Under the buyer agent's pre-approved mandate,

18
00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:43,140
the authorized agent executes releaseEscrow() autonomously, issuing Trust Receipt -- Simulated Demo.

19
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:46,800
But commerce has a harder case.

20
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:52,200
What happens when the evidence does not establish a clear outcome?

21
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:57,800
VeriqoMesh does not give the AI unilateral authority to decide the dispute.

22
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:03,130
The transaction remains ESCROW PROTECTED, and the dispute moves into structured human adjudication.

23
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:07,800
This is the LIVE MONAD TESTNET RECORD: Transaction 0x2b57...cfc4.

24
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:14,500
The transaction reached verification, but the evidence was INCONCLUSIVE.

25
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:20,200
That prevented the normal release path and moved the transaction into dispute.

26
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:22,800
AI is still useful here.

27
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:30,200
It organizes the timeline, compares evidence, identifies contradictions, and prepares a structured dossier for the human adjudicators.

28
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:37,770
AI ANALYZED -- HUMAN REVIEW REQUIRED. But the AI dossier is advisory: AI HAS ZERO FINANCIAL OR VOTING AUTHORITY.

29
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:42,500
Three assigned judges independently submitted 3 INDEPENDENT SIGNED BALLOTS.

30
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:48,800
Their positions were 1000 BPS, 1500 BPS, and 2000 BPS.

31
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:53,200
The deterministic consensus rule takes the MEDIAN: 1500 BPS.

32
00:02:53,500 --> 00:03:00,500
With a spread of 1000 BPS -- below the 4000 BPS threshold -- the result is NON-POLARIZED.

33
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:05,860
The result is therefore eligible for the settlement authorization path.

34
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:12,800
Once the adjudication satisfies the SETTLEMENT AUTHORIZATION GATE, the designated resolver dispatches the onchain settlement.

35
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,800
The blockchain enforces the final state.

36
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:22,200
This live Monad transaction 0x91ff...84ba reached STATE 11 -- SETTLED.

37
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:28,590
The resulting VeriqoMesh TRUST RECEIPT #2 is a non-transferable accountability record of what happened.

38
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:32,000
That is the VeriqoMesh model.

39
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:35,200
Autonomy where the transaction is clear.

40
00:03:35,500 --> 00:03:38,800
Accountability where the outcome is contested.

41
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:42,650
And deterministic blockchain enforcement at the settlement layer.

42
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:49,500
As AI becomes a participant in commerce, trust cannot depend only on who is operating the system.

43
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:57,800
The transaction itself needs an accountable record of what was agreed, what happened, how it was verified, and how it was resolved.

44
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:01,800
That is VeriqoMesh Network.

45
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:07,500
AI executes. Humans adjudicate. Blockchain enforces.

46
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:15,680
DEFINE THE DEAL. PROTECT THE TRANSACTION. VERIFY THE OUTCOME.
